{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近の中田について"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近ブログで書いたなかったから\nざっくり書きます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/07/7795183/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Stella☆Beatsの桜木琴歌ちゃんとご飯行ったよ～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前にも書いたけど\nお友達なの～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいお話ししたら\n頑張らなきゃって鼓舞された"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/07/7795183/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"琴歌さん本当に素敵(*°-°*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ママと振袖の小物を買いに行ってきた！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"振袖はママのを着るって\n小さい頃から決めてたけど\n実際に着てみたのは初めてだった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小物だけ買い足して\nコーディネートしてもらったよ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は赤坂元気劇場でヲタ活"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沸いた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/07/7795183/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って感じの最近でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2014/09/07/7795183/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"typ